<title>DENMARK: Danish June T-bill auction draws lower rates.</title>
<headline>Danish June T-bill auction draws lower rates.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's central bank said on Friday its monthly treasury bill auction resulted in minimum rates of 3.51 percent for the three month series, 3.60 percent for the seven month series and 3.70 for the new 10-month series, which replaces nine-month paper.</p>
</text>
